Package: mainuan-video-player
Version: 1.0.1-3
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: David Caixinha
Installed-Size: 9172
Depends: libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.22), libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.9), libglib2.0-0, libmpv2, mpv, ffmpeg, libpulse0, libc6 (>= 2.39)
Section: video
Priority: optional
Description: Hardware-accelerated video player (GTK4/libadwaita + mpv)
 Mainuan video player is a hardware-accelerated video player built with
 GTK4, libadwaita and libmpv. Includes upscaling shaders (FSR, CAS,
 Anime4K, RAVU) and translations in many languages, including pt-PT.
